    "七神凛": "1girl, nanagami_rin, blue_archive, short hair, blue hair, glasses, halo, office lady, suit, pencil skirt, blue necktie",
    "由良木桃可": "1girl, yuragi_momoka, blue_archive, short hair, pink hair, halo, eating, holding chips, pink hoodie, lazy",
    "岩柜步": "1girl, iwabitsu_ayumu, blue_archive, black hair, short hair, halo, suit, business attire",
